# Erie Navigator - Environment Variables
#
# IMPORTANT: The static site version does NOT require any API keys!
# You can run the site without creating a .env file.
#
# These variables are only needed if you want to enable the AI chat feature (currently disabled)

# ============================================
# OPTIONAL - Only if enabling AI Chat
# ============================================

# OpenAI API Key (for AI chat recommendations)
# Get one at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-api-key-here

# ============================================
# FOR DEVELOPMENT
# ============================================

# No environment variables needed!
# Just run: npm install && npm run dev
# Visit: http://localhost:5173

# ============================================
# NOTES
# ============================================
# - The AI chat is currently disabled (shows "Coming Soon" message)
# - All data is stored in JSON files (no database needed)
# - Business submissions use Netlify Forms (no backend needed)
# - This is a 100% static site - no API keys required!
